'''Himminafl''' is the fourth [[Polearms|polearm]].

* Its primary attack is a 3-stab combo with 2x damage on the last hit.
* The secondary attack is an AOE swing with a 3-meter radius that deals 1x damage and 6x stagger with no damage penalty against multiple targets. It also triggers a lightning effect with randomly spawned lightning bolts.

The Himminafl is capable of dispelling the [[Mist]] of [[Mistlands]] in a 9-meter radius.

