* Himminafl can also be upgraded at the [[Forge of Potential]] with a [[Black Marble Battle Idol]].

== Notes ==
* The secondary attack is enough to stagger most creatures.
* Despite the visual resembling a slash, the secondary attack deals piercing damage.
* The blade of the {{PAGENAME}} constantly sparkles with electricity; it also glows faintly blue at all times. It is very dim compared to most proper light sources, but can provide a small amount of light in the dark.
** The glow effect also makes players slightly easier to detect while [[Sneak_(Skill)|sneaking]], increasing the visibility of its holder by approximately 10%.

== Trivia ==
* The {{PAGENAME}} translates to "Heaven's Might" in Old Norse.
* Prior to [[Version history|patch 0.217.4]], the name of the {{PAGENAME}} was spelled "Himmin afl".

